    <string name="mango9_crm_reminder_info">Enable a reminder on each appointment. Banners appear while this account is selected and the app is open, and pause during calls. Snooze is saved to the CRM; it never changes the appointment time. Email/SMS reminders are managed on the appointment itself.</string>
